      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Seven places dependencies hide",
      "items": [
        "Table lineage, job-to-cluster-policy, job-to-secret-scope are the obvious ones",
        "Dashboard/query to SQL warehouse to tables is the one that looks migrated while querying stale source data",
        "System tables expose lineage directly — don't hand-parse SQL or notebooks"
