        "Splitting a component only pays off when it reduces risk more than it adds coordination overhead",
        "This output is what wave planning's dependency-count scoring consumes"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Two things automation can't resolve",
      "items": [
        "A cross-cluster edge is a risk signal, not an error — feed it to risk assessment's dependency-count dimension",
